  "outlook": "Outlook for the Fourth Quarter Fiscal 2025: The Company expects net sales to be approximately $434.0 million to $444.0 million in the fourth quarter of fiscal 2025, compared to $413.7 million last year, a growth rate of 4.9% to 7.3%. Gross margin is expected to be in the range of 44.0% to 44.5% and SG&A as a percentage of net sales is expected to be in the range of 16.0% to 16.5%."
